; The period lexer reads a yearless 02/29 in the year a journal date would
; get; when that year has no Feb 29 the period is an error, not a guess.

2024/02/29 Leap day
    Expenses:A    $1
    Assets:Cash

test reg Expenses --now 2025/06/15 -p 02/29 -> 1
__ERROR__
Error: Day of month is not valid for year
end test

test reg Expenses --now 2028/01/15 -p 02/29 -> 1
__ERROR__
Error: Day of month is not valid for year
end test
